										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/fm_bloodrune.dds',
										'desc' => 'Join the ranks of the brutal Draugrkin graverobbers with these Bloodrune facial markings. These skilled plunderers paint their faces in a ritual that imbues their markings with a metallic sheen, allowing them to easily recognize one another in dark places.',
