										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_giantsacrifice.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Nords are known for leading short, but vigorous lives driven by passion. Those with Giant sacrificial markings on their faces? The fire of life burns brightest in those with looming shadows cast over them.\"—Fadile Senoril',
