										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_glowgill.dds',
										'desc' => 'Under the light of the moons, after swearing an oath to defend the land, those chosen for the honor receive softly luminous facial markings. Maintain the favor of the land, and the marks continue to glow.',
