										'name' => 'Ebonheart Pact War Marks',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_allianceemblemebonheart.dds',
										'desc' => 'Prepare yourself for battle across Cyrodiil with facial paints that exhibit your alliance with the Ebonheart Pact. Blood for the Pact!',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								304 => array (
										'id' => 11225,
										'name' => 'Ayleid Face Ruinmarks',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_ayleidallure.dds',
										'desc' => 'This triangular light blue facial marking shows off your love of all things Ayleid—plus lends authority to your tales of Ayleid ruin exploits! Who would dare refute even the most audacious of your stories with this symbol on your brow?',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								305 => array (
										'id' => 11227,
										'name' => 'Cathay Baandari Face Brand',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_baandaribrand.dds',
										'desc' => 'During the Baandari Ritual of Pathkeeping, the highest ranked Baandari present bestows deep vermilion and brilliant white dots and crescents on a respected littermate. These marks acknowledge that the peddler lives by the Way of the Baandari.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								306 => array (
										'id' => 11230,
										'name' => 'Necrom Armiger Face Markings',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_necromarmiger.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Lord Vivec, heed my prayer. With your blessing, I traveled to Necrom. To tell my father`s spirit of an oath kept, duties done. My honor as a Buoyant Armiger upheld. As my father smiles down upon me, the Dead Keepers scribe upon my flesh.\"—Armiger Relura',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								307 => array (
										'id' => 11364,
										'name' => 'Dreamstrider Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_dreamstrider.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Do not talk to me of dreams. I`ve seen your dreams. Your nightmares. I`ve walked—and flown—alongside you through tragedy and awe. Vaermina`s gifts let me see much. Look here. She also marked my face. Today, I choose to show her art.\"—Tredyn Ildram',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								308 => array (
										'id' => 11366,
										'name' => 'Mycoturge Face Markings',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_fungifanatic.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The crossed mushroom stalks on my face indicate my expertise with crafting mage towers. Precision and accuracy meet at that spot. You need both to build a lasting tower for a mage and their extraordinary number of books.\"—Mycoturge Anisi Farano',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								309 => array (
										'id' => 11368,
										'name' => 'Nightmare Nest Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_nightmaresnests.dds',
										'desc' => '\"What you call reality is drudgery. We truly live only during the hours of sleep, when the Weaver of Dreams welcomes us into her many-layered nest of truth. See my face? This art marks that I`m hers. Live your true life. Join us.\"—Dreamdelver Marbruk',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								310 => array (
										'id' => 11411,
										'name' => 'Shattered Mirror Maze Face Marks',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_mirthlessmaze.dds',
										'desc' => '\"After a time, I found myself in the wending, ever-coiling hallways of a labyrinth. Despite the crepuscular atmosphere, I saw carved meter and verse `pon the walls. The words crept behind my eyes. Beneath my skin. As you can see.\" —Scribe Maylen',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								311 => array (
										'id' => 11462,
										'name' => 'All-Maker`s Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_allmakersblessing.dds',
										'desc' => 'Skaal artists scribe waved bands, signs of the All-Maker`s grace, upon the brows of the worthy. The ink they use combines the All-Maker`s six gifts: earth, fauna, flora, sun, water, and wind.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								312 => array (
										'id' => 11468,
										'name' => 'Highmane`s Hero Face Marks',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_alkoshsfavored.dds',
										'desc' => 'The Dragon King of Cats gilds his champions so their endurance and dedication may be seen by all. Those who bear this mark have borne great responsibility upon their shoulders and risen to heed the call.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								313 => array (
										'id' => 11486,
										'name' => 'Unfeathered Battle Visage',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_umarilsretribution.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The confrontation between the Star-Made Knight and Umaril the Unfeathered will fade into memory unless we keep it alive. Pelinal freed many from oppression. I hope, by inking my face, to invite conversations about this topic.\"—Lucius the Earnest',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								314 => array (
										'id' => 11493,
										'name' => 'Windcaller Face Markings',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_skychild.dds',
										'desc' => '\"May the skies smile upon you, caller of the winds. We recognize the delicate mark of your office upon your face and know the path you chose to walk with your creature companion holds darkness and great deeds. Let us help?\"—Nona the Wise of Solstheim',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								315 => array (
										'id' => 11498,
										'name' => 'Planemeld`s Master Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_planemeldsmaster.dds',
										'desc' => 'Reverence for the Lord of Lies prompts some to adorn their temples with the horns of Bal. Terrifying in their simplicity, they should deter assailants. But some swear they can see the Lord of Schemes himself staring back from within.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								316 => array (
										'id' => 11579,
										'name' => 'Eyes of the Prophet',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_prophetstears.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Weep, my child, for you have been blessed with a great and terrible gift. You alone know what is to come. Many are the seers whose words fall on deaf ears, only for calamity to strike. Pray for the present, and grieve for tomorrow.\" —Wise Woman Asani',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								317 => array (
										'id' => 11658,
										'name' => 'Mirrorscribe Face Markings',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_shatteredtext.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Those who seek the truth must learn to bear its scars. What was constrained to ink and parchment may shatter the mind when brought forth from the shelf. All writing inevitably links author and reader, for all time, for good or ill.\" —Cipher Ascien',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								318 => array (
										'id' => 11660,
										'name' => 'Magicka Everlasting Face Marks',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_magikaeverlastingfacemarks.dds',
										'desc' => 'Apprentices in the Mages Guild bond over stories of the day they fully understood the concept of \"everlasting magic.\" Some go so far as to have a distinctive sigil with a background pattern tattooed on their faces.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								319 => array (
										'id' => 11663,
										'name' => 'Mages Guild Sigil Makeup',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_magesguildsigileyes.dds',
										'desc' => 'Inspired by the Mages Guild, these markings use ingredients mixed into ink by an alchemical master. An illusion-working around the eyes finishes this mystical effect.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								320 => array (
										'id' => 11664,
										'name' => 'Midnight Rising Makeup',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_midnightrisingmakeup.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The midnight sky knows me. Its stars and moons lend meaning to my life. The tenebrous interstices reflect nothing back at me. So, any significance I give to it is both true and false. Does that answer your question about my facial art?\"—Rendorien',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								321 => array (
										'id' => 11883,
										'name' => 'Aristocratic Astrologer Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_nobleastrolger.dds',
										'desc' => '\"I asked the artist who will ink my face to use some aetherial dust in the ink when she mixes it. So, not only will a tasteful flourish enhance my visage, but a bit of wonder will forever be a part of me. I cannot wait.\"—Grandee Husni',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								322 => array (
										'id' => 11913,
										'name' => 'Sheogorat Face Branding',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_sheogoratfacebranding.dds',
										'desc' => 'Not all who visit Cheesemonger`s Hollow return the same. Sometimes those who escape remember nothing of the experience and must forever puzzle over how these cheese and butterfly tattoos showed up on their faces.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								323 => array (
										'id' => 11916,
										'name' => 'Archival Access Face Tattoos',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_archivalaccessfacetattoos.dds',
										'desc' => 'Please the filers of the Infinite Archive, and they may just grant you a facial tattoo to commemorate your time beyond the stacks. Who could pass up an ink-themed tattoo that uses archival ink and makes your eye color pop?',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								324 => array (
										'id' => 12249,
										'name' => 'Face Art of the Five Companions',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_fivecompanions.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Upon their brow the marks of heroism are borne. Let these symbols show all the peoples of Nirn that this bearer is a bringer of light and justice, and that no evil shall flourish where they go.\"—The Seer`s Adoration, translated',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								325 => array (
										'id' => 12251,
										'name' => 'Threads of Mirrormoor Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_itheliasthreads.dds',
										'desc' => 'All destinies may be changed, as the children of Mirrormoor know all too well. They wear glimmering threads upon their skin, to remind themselves that fate and the future are of one`s own making.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								326 => array (
										'id' => 12253,
										'name' => 'Veteran of the Infinite Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_veteranshomage.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Be mindful of wandering too long in the Infinite Archive, mortal. Even the most experienced scholar cannot comprehend all the dangers and delights of this place. And I really don`t have time to go looking for you.\"—Filer Eru',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								327 => array (
										'id' => 12255,
										'name' => 'Rose of Tamriel Face Marks',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_roseoftamriel.dds',
										'desc' => '\"My mother wasn`t pleased when she saw what I had inked on my scales. She would`ve preferred a rendition of the Hist or something from the Black Marsh. But I just like roses more.\"—Paints-with-Mud, Murkmire',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								328 => array (
										'id' => 12427,
										'name' => 'Unkindness of Ravens Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_unkindnessofravens2.dds',
										'desc' => 'Stylized raven art exists in several Tamrielic cultures. Artist-Adept Aimira, who created this tattoo, wanted something minimalist to draw attention to the eyes. \"I pulled on the themes I used in the body art. The overall effect is fierce, is it not?\"',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								329 => array (
										'id' => 12452,
										'name' => 'Golden Eye Gaze',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_gildedeyeblessing.dds',
										'desc' => 'The glint of gold tempts many. Wear this at your local Carnaval party to draw a greedy gaze.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								330 => array (
										'id' => 12453,
										'name' => 'Fabulous Diamond Eyes',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_jubileeeyes.dds',
										'desc' => 'Beauty is in the eye of the beholder, so they say. Although the soothsayers probably didn`t mean it to be quite so literal.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								331 => array (
										'id' => 12454,
										'name' => 'Soulburst Face Soulmarkings',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_soulburst.dds',
										'desc' => '\"A great cry rose up across all of Nirn at the time of the Soulburst. None who felt it were ever the same, and those who saw it were forever marked by that day.\"—The Forlorn Soul, translated',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								332 => array (
										'id' => 12482,
										'name' => 'Eyes of Sithis',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_eyesofsithis.dds',
										'desc' => 'It`s said those who enact the will of Sithis with perfect clarity will one day see the Night Lord himself. What that sight may do to the viewer is never discussed.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								333 => array (
										'id' => 12483,
										'name' => 'Cycle Behind the Stars Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_cyclicityoflife.dds',
										'desc' => 'Khajiit believe the guardian of the winds, Khenarthi, embraces their souls and takes them to Llesw`er once they finish their true path of the moons. Some ease the grief of a loved one`s absence by wearing face art symbolizing the wind guardian`s embrace.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								334 => array (
										'id' => 12485,
										'name' => 'Morag Tong Writ Count Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/fm_moragtongwritcount.dds',
										'desc' => 'When a Tong assassin runs out of room to count their kills on their body, they will elect to record new kills upon their face. Watch for these markings in seedy Vvardenfell alleyways, and run.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								335 => array (
										'id' => 12490,
										'name' => 'Night Mother`s Embrace Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_nightmothersembrace.dds',
										'desc' => 'The Night Mother still weeps for her children. It is this sorrow that gives death meaning and drives her assassins into the darkness.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								336 => array (
										'id' => 12678,
										'name' => 'Bloodmoon Eyes',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_bloodmooneyes.dds',
										'desc' => '\"When the blood moon rises over Hircine`s Hunting Grounds, when true bloodlust has gripped his faithful, when the thrill of the chase is at its peak, it is said the Lord of the Hunt will mark his hunters forevermore.\"—Tales from the Hunt, translated',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								337 => array (
										'id' => 12679,
										'name' => 'Feral Favor Face Tattoo',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_feralfavor.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The horns of the Lord of the Hunt are no ordinary antlers. They are not for petty shows of strength or even deterrence. They are true weapons of the hunt, and they have been used to gore and rend as much as any spear.\"—Tales from the Hunt, translated',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								338 => array (
										'id' => 12681,
										'name' => 'Black Sacrament Mass Face Marks',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_nightmotherscandleart.dds',
										'desc' => 'Enacting the Black Sacrament is said to leave a mark upon the soul. Some few choose to make that soul mark visible for all to see.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								339 => array (
										'id' => 12756,
										'name' => 'Apocrypha Corrupted Eye',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_markoftheforbiddeneye.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Oh this? Don`t fret, mortal. It may look frightening, but the One Who Knows granted it to me personally. With this eye, the secrets of reality are no longer hidden to me. I see the truth behind the words on the page, and I am grateful.\"—Cipher Lielle',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								340 => array (
										'id' => 12757,
										'name' => 'Mirrorweb of Memories Face Art',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_webofreflections.dds',
										'desc' => 'Some scars lie on the skin, easy to see and understand. Other are subtle, hidden by the trial of time. But some scars lie deeper still, only revealing themselves when the cracks begin to manifest on what was once a perfect mirrored surface.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								341 => array (
										'id' => 12759,
										'name' => 'Alliance Viper Pit Face Marking',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_entangledsnakes.dds',
										'desc' => '\"If you see folks with snake markings on their head, chances are they`ve survived many a fierce battle in Cyrodiil. Poor brave souls. You can tell some are ready to plow fields instead of spill blood.\"—Naire of Bruma',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								342 => array (
										'id' => 12761,
										'name' => 'Mirrormoor Memory Face Marking',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_mirrormoorsecho.dds',
										'desc' => 'Mere mortals were never meant to remember Mirrormoor. And yet, its power emanates across the Threads of Fate, leaving some marked by this forbidden knowledge.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								343 => array (
										'id' => 12763,
										'name' => 'Rajaska`s Snarl Face Tattoos',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_rajaskhassnarl.dds',
										'desc' => 'Namiira can grant power to those who fall, but at the cost of corruption to the soul and everything someone once was. Some rare few could help a Rajaska back to the light, but the knowledge of this ritual was lost long ago.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								344 => array (
										'id' => 12765,
										'name' => 'Mirrormoor Eyes',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_shardsofmirrormooreyes.dds',
										'desc' => 'The shimmering, glistening glow of Mirrormoor is stunning to behold, though few have seen it and remember the experience.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								345 => array (
										'id' => 12766,
										'name' => 'Face Soul-Mark of the Sapiarchs',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_sorcererkingsinsight.dds',
										'desc' => 'The pursuit of perfection is brutal when the Sapiarchs are involved. They may look elegant, but these markings are a sign the bearer suffered in the application. Remember this—and the cost of conformity.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								346 => array (
										'id' => 12788,
										'name' => 'Stone-Nest Orator Face Paint',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_stonenestkeeper.dds',
										'desc' => 'Bear the sigils of the ancient past upon your temples. And may the secrets of the Builders one day be revealed to you.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								347 => array (
										'id' => 12790,
										'name' => 'Carnaval Feathered Gaze',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_sanguinesfeatheredgaze.dds',
										'desc' => 'The burning passion within shines through your eyes. Feel your worries run down your face like teardrops of sin. That`s what Carnaval is really all about.',
										'type' => 17,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								348 => array (
										'id' => 12791,
										'name' => 'Blackwood Carnaval Face Paint',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrf_featherandbranchpaint.dds',
										'desc' => 'Every region celebrates Carnaval a little differently. In Blackwood, locals indulge in elaborate face and body painting while festivities rage on. The bright colors are said to draw the gaze of Sanguine himself.',
