										'desc' => '\"Designing for conditions in Vvardenfell is a stimulating challenge,\" says Voldsea Arvel. \"That`s why the outer layers of my Ashland Attire are of tightly-woven kresh fiber that just sheds ash and soot, so you can look like a lord even in an ash storm!\"',
