										'desc' => '\"This is a formal ceremony, yes? Fazudah sees a sash with a wrap. Loose, so that you can kneel and rise, kneel and rise. But embellished! With metal … plates? No. Coins. To remind you the cost of history. Perfect!\"—Fazudah',
