										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/cos_habilimentsofstasis.dds',
										'desc' => 'There is true grace in order, as this design demonstrates. Requested specially by a deep-thought philosopher, this artful garment exemplifies the simplicity of stasis. When one`s clothing lays as it should, order in all other areas of life follows.',
