										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_riften.dds',
										'desc' => 'The Riften Ratway contains many a ne`er-do-well, but that doesn`t trouble you because you`ve earned a high place among this disreputable bunch—and these tattoos prove it! Though blades cross your chest, none in the Ratway of Riften dare cross you.',
