										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_winterhold.dds',
										'desc' => '\"When you first joined the College, Shalidor`s magic imprinted your body invisibly. As you passed trials, marks began to appear. Now, having mastered your curriculum, your body exhibits them all. Congratulations.\"—Mage Vignarth, College of Winterhold',
