										'name' => 'Reach Rebel Body Markings',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_reach.dds',
										'desc' => 'Accents of red and white mark the bodies of those who have taken an oath to defend the Reach while under Arana`s command. Her own hand traces the symbols while her witchery changes the skin`s hue.',
