										'name' => 'Saliache Scholar Body Markings',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_ayleiddoor.dds',
										'desc' => 'A cadre of Ayleid scholars and explorers loved their studies of the Saliache Elves so much that they tattooed their bodies with \"the door to greater knowledge.\" To join their ranks is an honor preserved for the best Ayleid lorekeepers of the time.',
