										'name' => 'Blessed Life-Tree Body Markings',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_aylied.dds',
										'desc' => 'The brilliant hue of the Ayleid life-tree glows upon those who sought knowledge from the Ayleids—and somehow gained the favor of one of their spirits. While its glow may not light your way in Ayleid ruins, it might win the favor of any lingering ghosts.',
