										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/marking_body_hu_blackdrake.dds',
										'desc' => 'Made by applying a thick layer of soot and ash to the body and then carving away the paint with the fingers, this warpaint embraces the volatile nature of battle. Durcorach reportedly saw the pattern in the flickering flame of his hearth.',
										'type' => 18,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
