										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_xivilired.dds',
										'desc' => '\"I proudly displayed my rubyfire brand while I single-handedly decimated a Dremora regiment at Bellow`s Valley. If I see any Xivilai who have fled the field of battle showing their rubyfire marks, I will remove their flesh in strips!\"—Xalwif',
