										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_blkwoodforest.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Rivers may flow in one direction, but paths can be traveled in two. When dedicating space on your body to something as encompassing as the Blackwood forest, be prepared for the forest itself to judge your worth.\"—Root Herald Iokish',
