										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_systressentinel.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Life on the waters calls for courage, calm, and canniness. Show all three while we`re facing down Dreadsails or ornaug throngs, and we`ll take you out for Gonfalon grog and tattoos like mine.\"—Germonde Baduoin, Sailor',
										'type' => 18,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
