										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mrk_evermoresaint.dds',
										'desc' => 'Saint Pelin`s story is one of sacrifice. The Order of Saint Pelin honors his gift to this day. It`s traditional for blood from a new knight to be mixed with tattoo ink and used to create this sword and wing iconography.',
										'type' => 18,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
