										'name' => 'Deadlands Brand',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_deadlandsbrand.dds',
										'desc' => 'Do you revel in cataclysmic forces? Is vindication best reflected in ruining all who thwart you? Perhaps you revere the destructive Daedric Prince Mehrunes Dagon. Whatever the case, this ruddy-hued skin reflects your true nature.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
