										'name' => 'Bloodfiend',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_harrowfiend.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Whether afflicted by the Rivenspire blood-curse or some other vile vampiric corruption, the result is the same: Victims transform into ravenous monsters. These creatures know nothing but rage and hunger. Appalling.\"—Nalana, Advisor to House Tamrith',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
