										'name' => 'Runic Seabrume',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_seagiantv2.dds',
										'desc' => 'Enter crashing waves to take part in an ancient ceremony known only to the clever women of Skyrim. Runes bind your blood to the tides, and your skin mirrors the sea`s restless waters. To what end? Only time will tell.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
