										'desc' => 'Whether you hope to travel safely through the Fields of Regret by looking more like a Skaafin or wish to appeal to Clavicus Vile, this skin has you covered—literally.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								59 => array (
										'id' => 9789,
										'name' => 'Magmaheart',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_magmaheart.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Little stops the patient flow of magma, or so druids have always known. Seeing this quality in you, they whispered words that set your very being aflame. Now, I free you. Go, heart of magma. Burn.\"—Druid Llanith',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								60 => array (
										'id' => 9814,
										'name' => 'Impish Epidermis',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_impishepidermis.dds',
										'desc' => 'Morality is a useless cause with no end other than smug self-satisfaction. Cast that aside and showcase your mischievous nature. You`ll know you`ve succeeded in shirking your former self when your scarred skin pulls tightly across your chest.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								61 => array (
										'id' => 9836,
										'name' => 'Ocean Lamellar',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_brinebreaker.dds',
										'desc' => 'When threatened, the scales on some Sea Elves lengthen from flimsy scales to broad plates. With wider scales of your own, you`ll look ready for the danger of crossing the seas in search of enemies and adventure.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								62 => array (
										'id' => 10063,
										'name' => 'Brineglow',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_brineglow.dds',
										'desc' => 'Extensive proximity to a certain breed of ornaug may cause these unusual luminescent markings to appear. Or such is the claim of the druids. True or not, they make for great tavern discussions.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								63 => array (
										'id' => 10195,
										'name' => 'Reefdweller',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_glimmerstreak.dds',
										'desc' => 'The colorful inhabitants of High Isle reefs often act differently when land-dwellers approach. To better swim among the local aquatic life, druids imitate them by imbuing their skin with gorgeous blues and greens. Care to try it?',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								64 => array (
										'id' => 10196,
										'name' => 'Ethertide',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_ethertide.dds',
										'desc' => '\"I walked through the waters of the Ancient Darkness. The waves of the Void washed through me. Tread in the nothingness too long and it seeps into you. Mangles you. Twists you into something other than what you were.\"—Opius Balvel, Oblivion Walker',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								65 => array (
										'id' => 10323,
										'name' => 'Shallowbay Nereid',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_shallowbaynereid.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Splash among the fish and flora? Looking like a nereid scaled in hues of coral, pearl, and night? Speak to me no more of this pure joy. This unadulterated bliss. You merely tease, yes. Yet … magic, you say?\"—Tariran, Seeker of New Experiences',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								66 => array (
										'id' => 10659,
										'name' => 'Barkroot Blessing',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_forestspirit.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Some druids seek an understanding of nature by opening themselves to the cycle of the seasons. Rooted, they gain leaves and bark, taking in water and nutrients as would a tree. Or so the druids at the Jaded Ornaug claimed last night.\"—Aurelienne Broles',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								67 => array (
										'id' => 10661,
										'name' => 'Meadowbreeze Memories',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_aborealdelight_fem.dds',
										'desc' => 'Spring flows through your veins even as greenery traces itself across your skin, creating white blooming flowers. Thanks to Y`ffre, the scents and sensations of past springs on breezy meadows sweep over you.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								68 => array (
										'id' => 10907,
										'name' => 'Flesh of the Harrowed',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_harrowvoid.dds',
										'desc' => 'The power of the harrowstorm ripples just beneath your skin. Let that energy surge forth and impress—or terrify—all those around you.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								69 => array (
										'id' => 10908,
										'name' => 'The Taskmaster`s Banner',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_ordersmastery.dds',
										'desc' => '\"My task list saved me. Yes, I know. Every Peryite priest says that. It`s true in my case. So true that I prayed at the bank the moment I found out I`d barely missed a Dragon disaster at home. Now I look like this when I want to.\"—Slera Cinna, Banker',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								70 => array (
										'id' => 10910,
										'name' => 'Glimmertarn Glow',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_glistergloamglow.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Druid chants drift through the air as one of their number drinks deeply of the glowwine. Slowly, the alchemy spreads throughout the body and skin, suffusing it with the amaranthine-hued blessing of the God of Song and Forest.\"—Book of the Leaves',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								71 => array (
										'id' => 11080,
										'name' => 'Glowgill Guarhide',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_glowgill.dds',
										'desc' => 'Skin tone changes, taking on the texture of rough hide. Glowing blue markings. Some attribute these skin changes to the Hist. Riders of these glowing steeds believe that this transition occurs as you increase your bond with your beast.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								72 => array (
										'id' => 11098,
										'name' => 'Rain`s Hand Renewal',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_springsrenewal.dds',
										'desc' => '\"After a dry winter, priests of Y`ffre perform a ritual intended to ensure gentle storms arrive. During a successful ritual, leaves appear to grow on the body of a chosen one, who can forevermore call upon this leafy appearance at will.\"—Richien Thalin',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								73 => array (
										'id' => 11154,
										'name' => 'Do`Krin Ascetic`s Henna',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_penitentsinitiation.dds',
										'desc' => '\"To teach within the Order of the Claw, one must first pass the Trials of the Ascetic. In one trial, you must meditate without pause while another designs patterns on your skin with henna. Perhaps next time this one shall pass that trial.\"—Kansur-jo',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								74 => array (
										'id' => 11207,
										'name' => 'Spellscar Sheathe',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_spellscarintegration.dds',
										'desc' => 'The power of the Spellscar transforms your appearance with its mesmerizing display of colorful light peeking out from under a cracked shell of darkness. Those who recognize this effect may wonder if you`re entirely stable—which is exactly what you want!',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								75 => array (
										'id' => 11361,
										'name' => 'Harvestleaf Lacquer',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_autumnsadvent.dds',
										'desc' => '\"In my dream, the lava poured down the valley. I called to the winds and the trees to save me, and they answered. A shield from the flames. Their mark has never left me.\"—Initiate Selyna',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								76 => array (
										'id' => 11406,
										'name' => 'Preening Peacock',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_preeningpeacock.dds',
										'desc' => '\"I felt beige. All over. Very beige. People ignored me, and I was sad. Then I got an idea. People pay attention to peacocks. So, why not look more like them? Colorful. Delightful. And very much not beige. My magic worked!\"—Entry from an Anonymous Journal',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								77 => array (
										'id' => 11470,
										'name' => 'Orphan of the Stars',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_orphanofthestars.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The night sky isn`t absent of Meridia`s light, lonely one. In fact, it`s the place where it can be felt the most keenly, when the smallest mote of luminance stands in stark contrast to the abounding shadows.\"—Dorathil, Hollow City mage',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								78 => array (
										'id' => 11491,
										'name' => 'Ayleid Ruins Wildgrowth',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_ayleidruinswildgrowth.dds',
										'desc' => 'Potent magic lies buried in the roots of the Dawnwood. Ancient Ayleid ruins have been touched by the Green. Verdant, wild, and uncontainable, some resist the pernicious growth. Others embrace this fertile power.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								79 => array (
										'id' => 11495,
										'name' => 'Thief Starskin',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_thiefstarskin.dds',
										'desc' => 'When the Thief constellation shines brightest, bandits, assassins, and all who favor stealth and shadow breathe a little easier. Some hope for this protection every day, invoking the Thief`s blessing on their skin.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								80 => array (
										'id' => 11501,
										'name' => 'Shivering Isles Anointment',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_shiveringisles.dds',
										'desc' => 'Butterflies. Glowing pink eyes. The Shivering Isles calls to you. Will you fight the call or bend the knee to the Mad God?',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								81 => array (
										'id' => 11503,
										'name' => 'Aether-Tempered Mystic',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_aethertemperedmystic.dds',
										'desc' => '\"There are many wonders in this world, and many mysteries, too. One can never hope to unravel them all. Those who peer too deeply are likely to find themselves changed by the journey.\"—Mage Gwenieth',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								82 => array (
										'id' => 11551,
										'name' => 'Mystic Magicka Molt',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_magickaovercharged.dds',
										'desc' => 'Harnessing the power of magicka is an art—one that requires care. This source can be quite volatile at times, leaving arcane energy crackling just below the skin of the unwary user. Anyone can become a conduit if they are not careful.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								83 => array (
										'id' => 11886,
										'name' => 'Fractured Glory',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_fracturedglory.dds',
										'desc' => 'Sometimes the most beautiful things are those which have shattered and been pieced back together. Bear your cracks proudly—they are the hard-won trophies of all the things that could not break you.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								84 => array (
										'id' => 11890,
										'name' => 'Boralis Wolf Pelt',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_boraliswolfpack.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Be wary of spending too long in the wild, traveler. It may be freeing to give in to your more feral instincts in the moment, but too long away from civilization may reveal truths that were better left unspoken.\"—Widow Granger, Northsalt Village',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								85 => array (
										'id' => 11892,
										'name' => 'Skin of the Anchorite',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_pellicleofworm.dds',
										'desc' => 'The followers of Molag Bal give themselves over to the Prince`s will. For most, this means forfeiting their souls. For others, their sacrifice burns them from the inside out.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								86 => array (
										'id' => 11912,
										'name' => 'Bloodmarks of Malacath',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_malacathsblessed.dds',
										'desc' => 'Malacath demands utter devotion from his followers. Only the most ardent are rewarded with the chance to bloody their skin in his honor. The scars and wounds are a sign of one`s worthiness.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								87 => array (
										'id' => 12488,
										'name' => 'Black Sacrament Skincarving',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_bonefiligree.dds',
										'desc' => 'Some carve themselves in symbols of the Black Sacrament out of devotion to the Night Mother. Others do so because they came to the Dark Brotherhood after performing their own Black Sacrament. Which are you?',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								88 => array (
										'id' => 12489,
										'name' => 'Woebringer',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_woebringer.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Those who provide the gift of the Night Mother`s Kiss to others tend to dress in dark colors—the better to blend into shadows. But if you unwrap us, you may find the glorious hues of our guild`s stained glass writ upon our skin.\"—Nevusa',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								89 => array (
										'id' => 12687,
										'name' => 'Ardor`s Devotion',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_ardorsdevotion.dds',
										'desc' => 'You have bathed in the pool of Dibella`s adoration and come out transformed. Flowers of many pastel hues decorate your form, bringing joy and smiles to those who interact with you.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								90 => array (
										'id' => 12754,
										'name' => 'Fargrave Walker',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_empryrealfargrave.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Walk the streets of Fargrave. Take in the exotic scents of this fabled city. Listen to the mysteries that whisper to you with every breeze. And, when you`re ready, let the Celestial Palanquin claim you as one of its own.\"—Tirasie Mirel',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								91 => array (
										'id' => 12755,
										'name' => 'Mirrormoor Metamorphosis',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_mirrormoormetamorphosis2.dds',
										'desc' => '\"I find peace and soul`s release when casting on the `moor. With oiled skin, reflections spin, mirror`s grace implored. A shimmer here, a glimmer there, my form reflects the light. Forever lost, forever found, mirror`s fated knight.\"—Lost in Mirrormoor',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								92 => array (
										'id' => 12768,
										'name' => 'Warrior Starskin',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skn_warriorconstellation.dds',
										'desc' => 'Some claim that when the Warrior constellation shines brightly, those born under its sign are assured of victory in battle. Those who seek to win through force of arms often take on the Warrior`s mantle during times of great crisis.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								93 => array (
										'id' => 12986,
										'name' => 'Sanguine`s Disciple',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_sanguinesdisciple.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Nothing brings peace like a glass of wine and a little dancing! Under the skin, everyone belongs to Sanguine! We just bring that to the surface.\"—Ree-Jaa, Sanguine Disciple',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								94 => array (
										'id' => 12988,
										'name' => 'Dawnwood Tender`s Skin',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skn_woodelfcarnavalepaint.dds',
										'desc' => 'A binding mark that signifies a Dawnway follower`s resolve in following their Ayleid ancestor heritage.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								95 => array (
										'id' => 13101,
										'name' => 'Tactician`s Gold Lattice Skin',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_aureatetactician.dds',
										'desc' => '\"We imbue our skin with the Emperor`s Regalia as a declaration of our undying loyalty to Cyrodiil`s true emperor, Orpheon! Any that block his path to the throne shall see their own skin stripped and left to rot!\"—Orpheon Follower',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								96 => array (
										'id' => 13296,
										'name' => 'Blaze of Akatosh',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_akatoshs_blaze.dds',
										'desc' => 'Those who burn with the soul of the Dragon may be transformed by their own inner fire. Whether that power is used for good or ill is entirely up to them.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								97 => array (
										'id' => 13302,
										'name' => 'World-Eater`s Flame',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skn_alduinsflame.dds',
										'desc' => '\"What is flame but hunger never sated? What is Alduin, but an appetite with wings? Whether by fire or teeth, he consumes all.\"—The Song of Endings',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								98 => array (
										'id' => 13509,
										'name' => 'Twin Titan`s Retribution',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skn_retributionoftitans.dds',
										'desc' => 'The only thing worse than one titan is two. And the only thing worse than that is getting caught in the middle of them. Even if you make it out alive, you won`t be the same. Their power will mark you forever.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								99 => array (
										'id' => 13510,
										'name' => 'Magnifico`s Majesty',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skn_magnificosmajesty.dds',
										'desc' => 'Who says that necromancy has to be dull? Magnifico`s power is revealed to his followers in its full glory, utilizing Redguard motifs in an unprecedented way to adorn his vessel as a lich. Undeath has never looked this good.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								100 => array (
										'id' => 13511,
										'name' => 'Scaly Sun Basker',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_emeralddragon.dds',
										'desc' => 'Argonians and Khajiit are not the only ones who like a good long bask. In the days before mortals the Dragons loved to lounge with the warm sun on their scales. Make use of this illusion, and enjoy your own draconic scales.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								101 => array (
										'id' => 13616,
										'name' => 'Phantasma of Terror',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_vaerminasnightmare.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Eyes. Everywhere. Following my path, unblinking. In the paving stones, watching. On my arms, waiting. The mirror shows me they are me. I am them. What nightmare wrought by Vaermina do I now walk within?\"—Torn parchment being chased by dark winds',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								102 => array (
										'id' => 13755,
										'name' => 'Dreamharrowed Dancer',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_vaerminastormenteddancer.dds',
										'desc' => 'A dance begun, your feet take flight. Vaermina sings, you dream of night. The moons shine through your nightmare fate, but newly bound you see too late.',
										'type' => 11,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								103 => array (
										'id' => 13814,
										'name' => 'Xanmeer Defender',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_xanmeerdefender.dds',
