										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/sko_padomaysvoid.dds',
										'desc' => 'Those within the Chaos of Padomay cult believe they can \"touch Padomay`s void\" to transform into feathered-and-furred beings. Mages Guild scholars, however, believe these folk are under a permanent illusion spell, which they`d happily break.',
