										'name' => 'Eternal Marble',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_antipodalmarble.dds',
										'desc' => 'Like the firmament itself, you stand strong in your marble-skinned, statuesque form. You remain stable in the face of chaos itself. Best of all, perhaps, is when you cause people to jump when you suddenly move after standing still for so long.',
