										'name' => 'Arrow`s Sting',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/skin_tenmarssting.dds',
										'desc' => 'When local systems fail to protect the innocent from harm, forest archers may step in to mete out needed justice and equity. Every now and again, a tattoo artist finds one on their doorstep, seeking out full body art that speaks to their way of life.',
