										'name' => 'Duchess',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/personality_duchess_01.dds',
										'desc' => '\"One may have to associate with individuals of low degree, but that`s no reason for vulgar behavior, indelicate gestures, or poor posture. Class always tells, don`t you think?\" —Duchess Olivie Delrusc',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								11 => array (
										'id' => 604,
										'name' => 'Commander',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/personality_commander_01.dds',
										'desc' => '\"A commander must project confidence and mastery, or no one will want to obey her orders. Behave as if you`re the one making the rules, not following them. Walk like you own the place, and stand like an Emperor.\" —Magus-General Septima Tharn',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								12 => array (
										'id' => 605,
										'name' => 'Thief',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/personality_thief_01.dds',
										'desc' => '\"If you`re going to sneak, for the love of Tava don`t do it half-heartedly. Hide! Be furtive! Lurk like you mean it! Because I`m done bailing you out of the Abah`s Watch lock-up.\" —Zeira of the Thieves Guild',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								13 => array (
										'id' => 773,
										'name' => 'Jester',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/personality_jester_01.dds',
										'desc' => 'Whether you`re feeling flamboyant and theatrical, or just ready to jape and jeer at the world, adopt the mocking mannerisms of the Jester and poke some fun at those who take life too seriously. Time to yuk it up!',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								14 => array (
										'id' => 774,
										'name' => 'Deadlands Firewalker',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/personality_bretonhero_01.dds',
										'desc' => 'You wandered the turbulent landscape of the Deadlands and proved your strength. Flame is now your feisty partner instead of a deadly foe, ready to face whatever grueling challenges Oblivion has to offer.',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								15 => array (
										'id' => 775,
										'name' => 'Scholar',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/personality_scholar_01.dds',
										'desc' => 'Ever notice how everyone in Tamriel keeps a journal? Now you can show the world that you`re making your own scholarly record of your adventures and the deeds of those around you. Perhaps the pen IS mightier than the sword.',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								16 => array (
										'id' => 1192,
										'name' => 'Brassy Assassin',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/personality_naryu.dds',
										'desc' => 'Emulate the distinctive attitude of a certain bold and brassy Morag Tong assassin with this brash and irreverent personality—and just hope she finds it flattering rather than irritating!',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
								17 => array (
