										'name' => 'Worm Wizard',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/personality_necromancer.dds',
										'desc' => 'There`s just something about Worm Anchorites, those creepy necromancers of the Worm Cult, and the sinister way they act. It`s almost as if dealing with the undead has an unhealthy effect on one`s personality.',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
