										'name' => 'Master of Schemes',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pers_masterofschemes.dds',
										'desc' => 'Look at these fools, plotting your downfall. Luckily you`ve already put plans into motion. Plans within plans—enough to impress even Molag Bal! But these buffoons don`t understand the artistry of your endeavors. Perhaps you should enlighten them.',
										'type' => 9,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => '' 
								),
