										'desc' => 'Towering architecture, views to die (or kill) for, and a secret passage number among the many features of this striking Blackreach edifice, which stands within easy reach of Greymoor Keep.',
										'type' => 19,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/store/pc_collections_hsg_u26bastionsang.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Vampire Castle' 
