										'name' => 'Zhan Khaj Crest',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/housing_zhankhajcrest001.dds',
										'desc' => 'Breezes carry verdant scents from the nearby jungle to caress the sand gardens in this former Desert Wind adeptorium. Though no longer a site of Khajiit practicing a dual-sword technique, this riverside location serves well as a meditative getaway.',
										'type' => 19,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/store/pc_collections_hsg_zhankhajcrest_1x1.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Elsweyr Sand Garden' 
								),
