										'id' => 12472,
										'name' => 'Merryvine Estate',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/housing_merryvineestate001.dds',
										'desc' => 'Merryvine`s wines once rivaled those of the nearby Valente Vineyard, but misfortune sent its former owner fleeing. This sun-kissed estate features fertile grapevines, a house suitable for entertaining, and facilities that would please any vintner.',
										'type' => 19,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/store/pc_collections_hsg_merryvineestate_1x1.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Colovian Winery' 
								),
