										'name' => 'Star-Gazer`s Vigil',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/hsg_icon_stargazersvigil_64x64.dds',
										'desc' => 'This Star-Gazer observatory majestically dominates its cliffside Reach location, where its domed main building provides a clear view of the sky. The addition of other eye-catching features delight those who study celestial topics.',
