										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/assistant_gellenna.dds',
										'desc' => 'Gellena left the Icereach Coven to see firsthand what they loathed about other cultures—and to consider what scores she needs to settle. After adding Gellena to your home, you can set her on a path, plus you and your visitors can speak with her.',
