										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/assistant_premiumbanker_01.dds',
										'desc' => 'This severe mercenary is duty bound to guard your possessions with his life. Unless you`re in Cyrodiil or the Battlegrounds—his contract explicitly excludes travel there.\n\nWhen summoned, his banking services are available to you and your groupmates.',
