										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/comp_ember.dds',
										'desc' => 'A talented Mage and former street kid, Ember is a chaotic, earnest, notorious troublemaker. In short, she`s a certified disaster. Call this companion to your side for a bit of chaos and help her fuel her endless curiosity for mystic knowledge.',
										'type' => 27,
