										'desc' => '\"Label your fact from fiction, Mirannah! `The barding on Potentate horses shimmers due to a geas of loyalty Versidue-Shaie instilled in the materials.` No. It`s simply magic. But 2E 5 for their first use? Feasible.\"—Honorata Ancrus, Eyevea',
