										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_newmooncamel.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Those seeking their way on dark sands should consider the New Moon Camel. Some say it feeds off the night itself. I say maybe so.\"—Jonnet of the Sunwalkers',
