										'name' => 'Gloomspore Camel',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_gloomsporecamel.dds',
										'desc' => '\"A scholar sought a mount that would assume her burdens, so I gave her a Gloomspore Camel. Using scaly pholiota in its creation makes it less likely to complain at any weight it bears, plus gives it a bounce to its step.\"—Mage Naleldil',
