										'name' => 'Resplendent Sovngarde Camel',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/camelmount_goldensteed.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Camels do indeed thrive within Sovngarde. When called to join battle in Tamriel, these resplendent creatures eagerly race forward to meet their valorous riders. Do not believe the claims that they spit mead, though.\"—Clever Woman Moritra',
