										'name' => 'Akaviri Potentate Camel',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_otentatecamel.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The Potentate bought several herds of camels in 2E 25 for delivery to Versidue-Shaie, Mirannah of Gwylim states. `Reman desert pursuit` and `enchanted barding like bear` are also true. Chased by glowing camels—what a sight!\"—Honorata Ancrus, Eyevea',
