										'name' => 'Nenalata Ayleid Camel',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_ayleidcamel.dds',
										'desc' => '\"King Dynar insisted their camels leave Nenalata as well, setting them to carrying the gravely ill and fatigued among the evacuees. Their fortitude shone brightest with Silatam, who was the last camel standing each rest period.\"—Beredalmo the Signifier',
										'type' => 2,
