										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_darkflamecamel.dds',
										'desc' => '\"At first, Baezati was angry. They give him a camel? Baezati rides nothing less than a charger. But this one must confess he enjoyed the ride. It was smooth. Fast. Surefooted. Even the rocks around Hel Ra gave the beast no issues.\"—Baezati`s Travelogues',
										'type' => 2,
