										'name' => 'Pyrodraconic Camel-Lizard',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_pyrodraconiccamellizard.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Of course it`s not a real Dragon. That`s beside the point. Intense hue recoloration, brimstone expectoration, and a fusion of Wood Elf and Telvanni magical techniques? Tell Otheri the contract is fulfilled, and more.\"—Magister Varkenel',
