										'name' => 'Warrior Wave Painted Camel',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_ragadapaintedcamel.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Give your obedience to none save the gods of Yokuda. The Far Shores recede from he who leans upon thin-blooded shoulders, scornful of his feeble grasp.\"—Plea for Open Eyes',
