										'name' => 'Duo-Dynamo Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_groupmountspider.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Clearly the Dwarves liked to travel in pairs now and again, so they built this two-seated animunculi for that purpose. My partner and I adore using it on market day!\"—Delyna Ulvel',
