										'name' => 'Duo-Dynamo Burnished Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_duodynamoburnished.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Want a distraction? If you need to head overland to your mark, take your partner with you on a shiny Dwarven spider, make a showy arrival to draw eyes away from your third, and then get to business. Never fails … someone. Not me.\"—Dahnadreel',
