										'name' => 'Duo-Dynamo Argent Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_groupmountu29.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Need a mount that won`t eat you out of house and home? For two? Well, this argent Dwarven spider mount can manage both! And don`t worry about it losing its shine—it`ll gleam until the end of times.\"—Devbarth the Stablemaster',
