										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_mothermaramarehorse.dds',
										'desc' => 'In some towns, pledging oaths before Mother Mara is accompanied by a lavish gift. Legends describe a steed exchanged at Bravil, white as fresh snow and adorned with spring`s first flowers. And thus a tradition was born that has survived until today.',
										'type' => 2,
