										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_hewsbanepillionpalfrey.dds',
										'desc' => 'Smuggler crews in Hew`s Bane first trained these palfreys to bear two riders. Originally, the training was just a cover story to hide their illicit work. But they quickly found having a mount that could hold two extremely useful for heists.',
										'type' => 2,
