										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_nightmarepillioncharger.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Beware lone roads and moonless nights. Beware the haunted hooves. Beware the burning-coal eyes and the fiery trail that follows each dogged step. Most of all, beware of the path of the steed`s terrible riders.\"—Folk Legends of Tamriel',
										'type' => 2,
