										'desc' => '\"Good Neramo studied with the Spidersmith. So a many-legged multi-rider construct seemed a perfect choice: Dwarven chassis meets the design of mages and Khajiit, spun up in Orsinium steel. What would the Dwemer think if they could see it now?\"—Fazudah',
