										'desc' => '\"Placing the Potentate wolves in High Rock in 2E 4 seems off to me, but I find no texts disputing Mirannah of Gwylim`s notes. `Caused a panic in Shornhelm`—well, these wolves with their horned barding look menacing. Perhaps.\"—Honorata Ancrus, Eyevea',
