										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_blazebornwolf.dds',
										'desc' => 'None can say the Blazeborn Wolf lacks a bold appearance, formed from flames as it is. Even bolder, though, is its temperament, making it a perfect companion for racing through icy wastes to confront foes you deem worthy of your courage!',
