										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_stormsurgehowler.dds',
										'desc' => 'Covered in coral and barnacles, this unusual sea creature moves like rushing water, creating a smooth traveling experience for its riders. Some speculate that Kyne crafted them from a sea storm and sent them to land to find those who revere her.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Brinewalker' 
