										'name' => 'New Moon Fox',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_newmoonfox.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Do not underestimate the foxes trained by the Cult of the New Moon. Their glowing crimson eyes should be enough to warn you away. If you are foolish enough to attempt to steal an adult, say farewell to Nirn.\"—Jonnet of the Sunwalkers',
