										'name' => 'Umaril`s Radiance Wolf',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_umarilscovenantwolf.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Umaril sought to direct the paths of the conquered. `The creature must take initiative and stay the course.` Balancing these traits with loyalty took many seasons. May they forever direct the Unfeathered`s flocks.\"—Gandravanya`s Journal, Translated',
