										'name' => 'Duskember Fox',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_duskemberfox.dds',
										'desc' => 'A rare sight, these colorful foxes keep to the shadows in the wild. When trained to the saddle, they proudly display their glossy coats and fine saddlery. Their favorite food is snow berries, and they will do almost anything for their daily treat.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Gambolprance' 
