										'desc' => 'After an Investigator Vale story featured one of these variegated wolves native to Alik`r, their popularity as steeds rose among the ranks of the adventurous literati. Their loyalty may have, if anything, been understated in the story.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Yipper' 
