										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_shorsfox.dds',
										'desc' => '\"You may laugh, but like Shor, this fox has added years to my life. Years. Saved me from some giants by outwitting them. Hoisted me by my breeches out of the angry spring waters of the Yorgrim. I breed them now, so I named them.\"—Thorkell',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Stormreaver' 
