										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_solstheimshamanwolf.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Don`t muck with another rider`s wolf, unless you`re ready to meet the All-Maker. These are spirit beasts. They come when summoned, but they`re loyal only to their rider. I nearly lost a finger learning that lesson the hard way.\" —Hlokela, Solitude',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Sigridde' 
