										'name' => 'Order of the Lamp Jackal',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_orderofthelampjackal.dds',
										'desc' => 'Cunning and fast, this jackal has a laughing bark that echoes for miles. While they can be somewhat wild even to their riders, the jackal`s preternatural ability to find shortcuts and quick exits has made it a preferred mount for many Lamp Knights.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Cackle' 
