										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_wenayawend_wolf.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The Dawnwood`s new, but the forest`s roots reach deep. The Ayleids were here before us, and they left their own mark on the land. We tamed this beast through the Green, but Y`ffre knows how long it`s been out here.\" —Nothelas, Bosmer priest',
