										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_companionrevelrywolf.dds',
										'desc' => 'Said to have been tamed by Lyris Titanborn herself, this fierce wolf easily bears its rider across nearly any terrain. While the beast is a frenzied fighter on the battlefield, one word from its rider will have it waiting docilely for the next command.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Giantbearer' 
