										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_bloodmoonwolf_fix.dds',
										'desc' => 'It is said that when the bloodlust of Hircine`s Huntsmen goes unsated for too long, the collective prey drive forms a will and a shape of its own. Once its quarry is scented, the wolf will pursue at all costs, never stopping until it tastes blood.',
