										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_fireheartdeathhound.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Be careful! This beast is meaner than a durzog and hot as a fire atronach. The furnace in its chest gives it incredible power and an appetite to match. I can`t remember when last this one was fed. Best not to find out.\"—Kallin, House Ravenwatch',
