										'name' => 'Lucent Guardian Wolf',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_lucentguardianwolf.dds',
										'desc' => 'Traded in the merchant stalls of Fargrave, this beast is far from its native home in the depths of Valenwood. Specially trained to hunt Daedra from every realm, it tracks even the largest Ogrim without fear or uncertainty.',
