										'desc' => 'Molag Bal`s domain is patrolled by vampiric hounds. Wrapped in the mists of Coldharbour, bones erupting from flesh, it strikes fear into the hearts of others, and sometimes the hearts of their riders as well.',
										'type' => 2,
