										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_nordempywolfcombined.dds',
										'desc' => '\"This morning, a wolf painted with dawn`s glow awaited. Thanking Kynareth for prayers answered, I fed it, and we ventured out. That night, darkness settled on the wolf, broken only by the lunar luminescence of its markings.\"—Ada of Winterhold`s Journal',
