										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_u29ceelk.dds',
										'desc' => '\"At the Battle of Falinesti, several herds of Wood Elf totem elk vanished—some say to Khajiit scoundrels. Later, Falinesti Faithful regained them, gifting them to devout riders. What constitutes a devout rider? Ask them.\"—Flaccus Terentius',
										'type' => 2,
