										'name' => 'Umaril`s Radiance Elk',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_umarilscovenantelk.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The Unfeathered sought victory over the Sunnatren. `Their banners portray crude elks. Let them tremble as we defeat them on such beasts.` A season ended before I finished my work. May they forever remain loyal to him.\"—Gandravanya`s Journal, Translated',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Sancretren' 
								),
								14 => array (
