										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_faunfrolicgreatelk.dds',
										'desc' => 'Inspired by the knights of Castle Navire, a band of Fauns decided to breed elks as their mounts. They stopped when they realized their hooves made it difficult to ride and, in truth, they could run just as fast as the elks could.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Extraneous Hoof' 
