										'name' => 'Elden Root Elk',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_eldenrootelk.dds',
										'desc' => 'Legend says a trading caravan was once ambushed on its way to Elden Root. Only one survived. Days later they arrived safely, slung across the back of a majestic white-and-black elk. Perhaps you might make such a friend if you find yourself in need.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
