										'name' => 'Hollowsoul Steed',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_hollowsoulsteed.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The great expanse between the planes of the Aurbis is endless night, the Outer Darkness of the Void. Some few things, blessedly few things, live in this endless nothingness. And they are strange beyond imagining.\"—Azandar al-Cybiades',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Mourning' 
