										'name' => 'Nightmare Alchemy Elk',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_nightmaresalchemyelk.dds',
										'desc' => 'Cult priests form a compound with Blackwood herbs and bone salvaged from Quagmire and the Pits. The glowing solution guides this elk and its rider to Prince-favored destinations.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Phantasm' 
