										'name' => 'Ebon Steel Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mounticon_dwarven_spider_ebonyyellow.dds',
										'desc' => 'Though Dwarven Metal was usually employed in building Spider constructs, for reasons unknown some rare variants were built with a darker Ebon Steel alloy. When found in working order, these automata are prized by collectors.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Darkwalker' 
								),
								4 => array (
										'id' => 5698,
										'name' => 'Infernium Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mounticon_dwarvenspider_flame..dds',
										'desc' => '\"The Dwarven Spider Mounts from the Infernium Forge are unusual and distinctive, indicating to this Dwemer scholar that they all come from the hand of a single Deep Elf artisan.\" —Guylaine Marilie',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Big Emberlegs' 
								),
								5 => array (
										'id' => 6201,
										'name' => 'Ebony Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_ebonydwarvenspider.dds',
										'desc' => 'Not only is this vamidium crafted from an Ebony and Ebon Steel alloy, but it also has the form of a Dwarven Spider, making it a must-have for those who prefer dark clothes and darker lives.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Drearshade' 
								),
								6 => array (
										'id' => 6204,
										'name' => 'Baandari Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_baandaridwarvenspider.dds',
										'desc' => 'The long-lost Dwemer never spread as far as Elsweyr, but the Baandari Pedlars go everywhere, and will adapt even ancient technology to their uses.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Rattleclink' 
								),
								7 => array (
										'id' => 6684,
										'name' => 'Frost Atronach Dwarven Spider^n',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_frostatronachspider.dds',
										'desc' => 'Few mages possess the power to press a frost atronach into service—but twisting its form into that of a Dwarven spider? That takes a rare gift. And with the sun glinting off it as you ride it, you`ll cut quite an imposing figure!',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Shiverchill' 
								),
								8 => array (
										'id' => 9575,
										'name' => 'Coral Crawler Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_coralcrawler.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Do these coral spiders simply mimic Dwarven spiders or did coral grow over a discarded animunculus? I haven`t pried one open to find out—they really don`t like that, so don`t even try.\"—Wheezing Wilren',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Cruncher' 
								),
								9 => array (
										'id' => 11072,
										'name' => 'Buoyant Armiger Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_buoyantarmigerdwarvenspider.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Intense shudders wracked the spider of Dwarven make. `It smells most foul. Let us repair its workings for Lord Vivec. Its perpetual existence shall provoke needed change among us.` And so it joined the bear.\"—Armiger Tharys`s Journal',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Perpetuity' 
								),
								10 => array (
										'id' => 11162,
										'name' => 'All-Maker`s Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_all-maker-dwarven-spider.dds',
										'desc' => '\"I don`t normally consult on the personal projects of other folk, but it was an honor to study beside you. Whatever gave you the excellent idea to overhaul it in the style of the Skaal?\"—Neramo, in a letter to the artisan known as the Spidersmith',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Ironweb' 
								),
								11 => array (
										'id' => 12658,
										'name' => 'Glass Atronach Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_glassatronachspider.dds',
										'desc' => '\"In pursuit of ever more esoteric materials, I have drawn upon the most curious of realmic threads. Shards of mirror unending, on to the horizon and more. The whole place permeated with the deepest sense of loss.\" —Journal of the Spidersmith',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Akuzzel' 
								),
								12 => array (
										'id' => 12802,
										'name' => 'Law of Julianos Dwarven Spider',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_julianosruinedspider.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Dwemer design married to the unyielding logic of Julianos. One of my finest creations. The first of this design was personally delivered to my patron in Wayrest, along with a fabulous bottle of wine.\"—The personal notes of the Spidersmith',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Obstinate Obedience' 
								) 
						) 
				),
				10 => array (
						'subCategoryIndex' => 10,
						'name' => 'Senche-Raht',
						'numCollectibles' => 18,
						'collectibles' => array (
								1 => array (
										'id' => 5708,
										'name' => 'Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mounticon_monstroussenche_raht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Largest of all the furstocks, or \"breeds\" of Khajiit, the Senche-raht is fully intelligent, and in combat often serves simultaneously as warrior and mount.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Humongous' 
								),
								2 => array (
										'id' => 6489,
										'name' => 'Whispering-Claw Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_sencherahtc.dds',
										'desc' => 'Feanirr witnessed the demise of her proud adeptorium, not to war, but to a sickness faster and stealthier than all but her. Since then, she lives only in the moment, knowing that at any moment something deadlier than her could catch her by the tail.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Feanirr' 
								),
								3 => array (
										'id' => 6490,
										'name' => 'Queen`s Claw Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_queenclawsencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'A scholar studying Mnemoli the Blue Star as well as a Whispering Claw warrior, this Senche-raht serves Queen Khamira with both brain and brawn. He volunteered to travel with you, lending you speed and steady companionship.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Sarshaar' 
								),
								4 => array (
										'id' => 6491,
										'name' => 'Goutfang Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_goutfangsencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'After spending many years in a Vrin-Thak adeptorium, this powerful Senche-raht decided it was time to work with someone who regularly goes toward danger. She prefers to learn by watching, however.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Daibayda' 
								),
								5 => array (
										'id' => 7078,
										'name' => 'Cursebound Senche-raht Darkfang',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_curseboundradraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Zarnor, seeking to quench his insatiable curiosity, took part in experimental rituals that twisted and marked him. Though he still seeks to satiate his ceaseless desire for knowledge, he does so to free himself from servitude to loathsome masters.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Zarnor' 
								),
								6 => array (
										'id' => 7786,
										'name' => 'Cursebound Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_curseboundraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Once known as the toughest Baandari thief in the Stitches, Abahayda ran afoul of a terrible curse in the Ashen Scar. She seeks a companion who will help restore her former life and vigor. Is that you?',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Abahayda' 
								),
								7 => array (
										'id' => 8521,
										'name' => 'Dunewalker Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_dunewalkersencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'The Dunewalkers once roamed deserts beyond Elsweyr, seeking knowledge amid the sands of other lands. Mighila seeks to return to that tradition, hoping to bring back information on how to definitively vanquish the Dragons. Will you assist her?',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Mighila' 
								),
								8 => array (
										'id' => 8522,
										'name' => 'Spotted Duneracer Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_queenssencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Years of winning racing competitions finally bored Hazazkheran, so he ran messages for the queen for a time. Alas, even that grew predictable. Now he wants to poke his whiskers into all the hidden corners of the world—perhaps with you.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Hazazkheran' 
								),
								9 => array (
										'id' => 9979,
										'name' => 'Midnight Cantor Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_stygiansencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'After spending years expelling dro-m`Athra from Nirn, M`aar decided to follow a new path. Now they hope to explore as much of the Mundus as possible before venturing to the Gates of the Crossing.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'M`aar' 
								),
								10 => array (
										'id' => 10599,
										'name' => 'Umbral Striped Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_umbralstripesencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'When this beautiful beast lost their rider while traversing a labyrinth, this banded Senche-raht left to seek mystical help to get back inside. Since their efforts often lead them into peril, Nushaben hopes to find a partner for the long journeys ahead.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Nushaben' 
								),
								11 => array (
										'id' => 10616,
										'name' => 'Ahz-m`Athra',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_namiiraschampionsencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Yahareni sought to survive by any means necessary when the Knahaten Flu struck Orcrest. Death won, and Namiira gained their corrupted soul. Now, freed from the Dark Behind the World by a foolish mortal, they seek an equal to walk beside them in darkness.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Yahareni' 
								),
								12 => array (
										'id' => 11161,
										'name' => 'All-Maker`s Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_all-maker-senche-raht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Unlike other Senche-rahts, Thryn has accepted many riders in its time, though only a few have lasted beyond one battle. This is due to Thryn`s habit of testing its rider`s mettle with daring maneuvers and wild risks—all in the name of a good story.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Thryn' 
								),
								13 => array (
										'id' => 11240,
										'name' => 'Sagacious Psijic Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_sagaciouspsijicsencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Aloof and strangely mournful, there`s no question Pirzbi wields powerful magic. Some say their innate ability and keen intellect have become an obstacle for those who wish to partner with them. Perhaps you will find success where they did not.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Pirzbi' 
								),
								14 => array (
										'id' => 11642,
										'name' => 'Worm Cultist Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_wormanchoritesencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Legend says that Mannimarco himself indoctrinated this Senche-raht to the way of the Anchorite. It`s unknown if Zalzagh knows whether this is true, or if they have any recollection of life before joining the Worm Cult.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Accursed Zalzagh' 
								),
								15 => array (
										'id' => 12260,
										'name' => 'Ardor`s Devotion Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_ardorsdevotionsencheraht_fix2.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Why the flowers? Because this one finds them beautiful, that`s why. Charging into battle together does not mean we can`t enjoy their colors. And a battlefield littered with petals is a sight to behold.\"—Mathi-jo',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Mathi-jo' 
								),
								16 => array (
										'id' => 12478,
										'name' => 'Lucent Guardian Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_lucentguardiansencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => 'Chirhazi has fought more Daedra than most know exist. She`s become accustomed to the protective armor necessary for such battles and willingly allows her partner to be her eyes.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Chirhazi' 
								),
								17 => array (
										'id' => 12969,
										'name' => 'Scaleborn Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_scalebornsencheraht.dds',
										'desc' => '\"We`ve received the scavenged material and the specifications for the product line. This is all very doable, but will likely be somewhat expensive given the properties of draconic fleshweave.\"—Magister Varkenel',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Khrassa`hai' 
								),
								18 => array (
										'id' => 14091,
										'name' => 'Tenmar`s Fang Senche-raht',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_tenmarfangsenchraht.dds',
										'desc' => '\"You may question this one`s methods, but Rakamu does what he must. He protects the weak, stops injustice, and steals from those fat cats who have forgotten how to share. It is also great fun. You will join him now, yes?\"—Rakamu the Bandit',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Rakamu the Bandit' 
								) 
						) 
				),
