										'name' => 'Timber Mammoth',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_timbermammoth.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Behold the mammoth. Bred among the majestic trees of Malabal Tor. Let its strength endow you with courage and its even-tempered persistence carry you safely. And let its beauty uplift your soul.\"—Overheard at the Baandari Trading Post',
