										'name' => 'Na-Totambu War Elephant',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_warelephant.dds',
										'desc' => 'Forged by the talented hands of Crown-trained armorers. They turn metals cleaved from Hammerfell earth and worked in local forges into durable protection for this well-trained elephant. Better to be on this warbeast than in front of it.',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
