										'name' => 'Shackled Titan',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_fallentitan.dds',
										'desc' => '\"This titan failed the Dark Lord once, and paid the price for it. After he ripped off its wings, Molag Bal bound it to his dark will, making it a useful—if grounded—mount for his more faithful servants.\"—Worm Cultist Valoel',
										'type' => 2,
