										'name' => 'Manifestation of Chaos Steed',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_padomaysvoidsteed.dds',
										'desc' => '\"My prayers are answered! The magnificence of this steed near makes me weep. No longer will I suffer under the yoke of unending oppression. May Padomay`s Void claim any who dare stop me from spreading chaos!\"—Excerpt from a Yellowing Journal',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Chaosbringer' 
								) 
						) 
				),
