										'name' => 'Graniteclaw Durzog',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/mount_graniteclawdurzog.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Graniteclaw Durzogs gorge themselves on the array of sea life swimming around the Systres Archipelago. Their markings help them blend in with the reefs and their feathers keep water from dripping into their eyes.\"—Excerpt from Physiology of Amphibians',
										'type' => 2,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Stormscourge' 
