										'name' => 'Orchid Nixad',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_057.dds',
										'desc' => 'The rarest of these fay creatures is the Orchid Nixad, said to be sacred to the goddess Dibella, and found only in wild places hallowed to her worship. It`s known that the Empress Tavia had an Orchid Nixad as a friend and companion.',
