										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_093.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The Ancestor Moths that accompany some mystically-attuned mortals are more than mere insects—they are animated by the loving spirits of the dearly departed, and may grant wisdom and awareness to those they visit.\" —Sister Terran Arminus',
