										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_lunarmothvar2.dds',
										'desc' => 'Quiet, tree-shaded lakes attract these blue-purple moths. Legends claim they glide on starlight and rest upon the Moons` reflections in the water. If one follows you away, good luck is said to bless your path.',
