										'name' => 'Yoltoor Dovah-Fly',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_yoltoordovafly.dds',
										'desc' => 'Shimmering like fire, these dovah-flies dart around port cities, eating many of the nuisance insects that pester transported livestock. Recently, merchants started training and selling them to help others with insect issues.',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Flycatcher' 
								),
