										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_wasp.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Clearing wasps from the Betnikh docks falls to our youngest warrior. One such asked a mage to help her befriend the wasps, and she led them away. All but one settled elsewhere, instead choosing to follow her loyally. I see you have one now.\"—Stulga',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Zertzug' 
