										'desc' => 'The wasps found in the heart of the woods around Lake Honrich use mud to build their nests. While they normally keep out of sight, they swarm any who threaten their nests. Those who help defend against intruders may just find a friend following them home.',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Deathdauber' 
