										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_evermoreraven.dds',
										'desc' => '\"The ravens of Rivenspire are some of the smartest in all of Tamriel. Something about surviving in such an inhospitable land, I think. This fine fellow has been my companion on many a long night in the study.\"—Lady Felyse Talemelier',
