										'name' => 'Vivec`s Promise Butterfly',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_vivecspromisebutterfly.dds',
										'desc' => 'Like the Warrior-Poet himself, this striking butterfly is bisected by two distinct color palettes. The Tribunal`s faithful consider it a good omen to see one of these creatures, and a blessing from Lord Vivec himself if one chooses to follow you.',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Felicitous' 
