										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_prismwasp.dds',
										'desc' => 'These mesmerizing creatures hail from the Daedric realm of Mirrormoor. Unlike some of the other denizens of that realm, Crystaljacks appear to be organic in nature, with shimmering skin that simply mimics the appearance of mirrored surfaces.',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Prisma' 
