										'desc' => '\"This one has always admired the owls around here. Very wise creatures. Most do not get too close, even when offered treats. Most, but not all. This is Hooty. A very clever name, yes? What else does one call a pet owl?\"—Traveling Merchant J`margo',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Hooty' 
