										'desc' => 'Few birds are as intelligent or vain as the Moorpecker Magpie. Prized by scholars and mages alike for their keen instincts and trainability, the birds can be huffy and prone to temper tantrums when not rewarded with shinies for their work.',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Handsome Vyr' 
