										'name' => 'Balfiera Senche Cub',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_balfierasenchecub.dds',
										'desc' => 'Bred for their lithe frame and large eyes, these senches excel at tracking prey through the dark underbrush of Balfiera. The Direnni Hegemony fell, but their senches prowl on, hunting during the night and sharpening their claws during the day.',
