										'desc' => 'Years ago, vermin overran Kvatch during a poor harvest year. To combat this threat to their low winter food supplies, the citizens brought in spotted lynx cubs from breeders. These creatures love freshly hunted vermin, warm hearths, and crusty bread.',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Biscuitmaker' 
								),
