										'name' => 'Autumnal Indrik',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_harvestfireindrik.dds',
										'desc' => 'As the weather chills and leaves take on fiery hues, the spirit of this young indrik begins to stir. When a paladin of Jephre performs an act the God of Song and Forest finds worthy, it takes its shaky steps into the world.',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Fireleaf' 
