										'name' => 'Silver-Bellied Guarling',
										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_silverlimnedguar.dds',
										'desc' => '\"In retrospect, attempting to add nirnroot to molten silver by using magic was a terrible idea. Now my guarlings and I are covered in silver, blue, and black streaks. Nothing I do will change us back. At least it`s attractive!\"—My Experiments, Vol. 5',
										'type' => 3,
										'image' => '/esoui/art/icons/icon_missing.dds',
										'nickname' => 'Mishap' 
