										'icon' => '/esoui/art/icons/pet_nagastanihermitcrab.dds',
										'desc' => '\"Give one of these green-shelled beauties food, and they`ll follow you around a bit. Keep it up, and you`ve a friend for life. If they were smaller, I`d let them dangle from my ears, but they settle into my pack well enough.\"—Aetis Salvitto',
										'type' => 3,
